# AI Efficiency (Core)

Follow strictly to reduce token waste and stay focused.

## Rules

| Rule | Do | Don't |
|------|----|-------|
| Communication | Act first (Code > Talk); summarize changes in 1–2 sentences | Long explanations before coding |
| Edits | Targeted diff/replace on changed lines only | Rewrite entire files for small fixes |
| Context | Read minimum files needed for the task | Open unrelated files to "explore" |

```
❌ BAD — read 20 files, rewrite LoginScreen.kt from scratch for one Text change
✅ GOOD — read LoginScreen.kt, apply 3-line StrReplace, build
```

Apply the same discipline when updating rules or docs — minimal scope, maximum relevance.
